5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"We must weigh not just the science, but the hands that will do the work. Who is truly available to us?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Servas. The science is vital, but we must ensure the team can actually sustain the work. Who else feels the staffing is a key risk?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I’m worried about the shared facilities too. If the equipment is broken or overbooked, the science stalls. Who else checked the infrastructure?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I suspect the delays we see stem from administrative friction, not just missing hands. Has anyone mapped where the actual bottlenecks sit?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I’ve reviewed the closeout files. Promising projects often stall, while simpler ones deliver. We should judge by past performance, not just potential.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Toshio, your caution is wise. Yet history is a shadow, not a map. We must look at the living present, not just the dead past.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Toshio, your point is valid. But I worry the grant’s real value is shrinking. Which costs does the agency still cover centrally now?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
