47,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, that’s a tough spot. But with the repository now fast, we can share data quickly even if the analysts are away.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, speed is irrelevant if the data is useless. @Toshio, your point about durability is key. We need outputs that survive the team’s departure, not just fast processing.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Benjamin, durability is the metric. Catalogue awards persist; mechanism studies stall. We must fund what outlasts the team, not just what moves quickly.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
