51,2,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. We must balance the free computing with the rising animal costs. Let us see which candidates fit this new reality.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I’m relieved the data sharing is fast now! It means we can publish quickly even if the equipment is tricky. Let’s hope the candidates fit!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
